      <p begin="00:06.740" end="00:12.010" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa, whoa</p>
      <p begin="00:12.010" end="00:13.880" ttm:agent="v1">Vengaboys are back in town</p>
      <p begin="00:13.880" end="00:20.720" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa, whoa</p>
