      <p begin="00:26.170" end="00:27.870" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:27.870" end="00:31.310" ttm:agent="v1">If you're alone and you need a friend</p>
      <p begin="00:31.310" end="00:34.700" ttm:agent="v1">Someone to make you forget your problems</p>
      <p begin="00:34.700" end="00:38.100" ttm:agent="v1">Just come along, baby, take my hand</p>
      <p begin="00:38.100" end="00:41.550" ttm:agent="v1">I'll be your lover tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:41.550" end="00:44.970" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa, this is what I wanna do</p>
